  "summary": "Bundled root certificates allow trust in distrusted emSign intermediates",
  "details": "Affected versions include `emSign ECC Root CA - G3`, which can allow certificate\npaths through distrusted emSign intermediates.\n\nAffected versions may accept certificate paths containing distrusted emSign\nintermediate public keys. The private keys corresponding to these intermediates\nare now well known.\n\nVersion 1.0.10+ removes this root.\n\nThe `webpki-roots` 0.26.11 compatibility package contains no independent trust\nstore and re-exports the roots from its separately resolved 1.x dependency.\nThat parent dependency must resolve to 1.0.10 or newer; an older parent remains\naffected by this advisory.",
